{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 61,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9009399414062,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "All included studies were conducted in LMIC. Specifically, two studies were conducted in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        527.0706176757812,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Thailand, one in Malawi, one in both Malawi and Viet Nam, and one each in India and Cameroon.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.8704833984375,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "The studies were conducted between 2014 and 2021 across various settings, such as outpatient",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.953601837158203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        527.0031127929688,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "departments at health centres, peripheral laboratories, a laboratory for the development of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.9634399414062,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "modified TB LAMP, and prisons and villages involving inmates and refugees. One study used",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.9654541015625,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "sputum samples from people known to have TB, and another used fine needle aspiration of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        527.0028076171875,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "lymph node samples from HIV-positive patients with TB lymphadenitis. The other four studies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.66119384765625,
        345.89520263671875,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "used sputum samples from people with presumptive TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        526.9568481445312,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "According to the three costing studies, the cost per test ranged from US$ 1 to US$ 19 (all",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.16522216796875,
        526.9589233398438,
        230.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "values in 2024 US dollars). All these studies used in-house techniques and were not using the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.66522216796875,
        526.7404174804688,
        245.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "commercially available TB LAMP test. The reviewed studies found that factors such as batching",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.985840797424316,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.16522216796875,
        527.2706298828125,
        261.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "scenarios and larger test capacity influence the per-test cost, with the cost per test decreasing in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95792007446289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.66522216796875,
        526.794677734375,
        276.81024169921875
      ],
      "text": "specific scenarios. Testing volumes, location and operational parameters can also affect the cost.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946369171142578,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.16522216796875,
        527.1875,
        292.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "Notably, the cost–utility analysis positioned TB LAMP favourably in terms of cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998149871826172,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.66522216796875,
        286.47430419921875,
        307.81024169921875
      ],
      "text": "compared with other diagnostic algorithms.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.66912841796875,
        526.9656982421875,
        331.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "The findings of the cost–utility analysis suggested that TB LAMP, followed by DST, is not only",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.1690979003906,
        526.9720458984375,
        347.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "effective but also cost-saving when compared with the standard diagnostic approach (i.e. smear,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.6690979003906,
        524.29638671875,
        362.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "culture and DST). These results provide valuable insights for health care practitioners and policy-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.953853607177734,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.1690979003906,
        518.158935546875,
        378.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "makers in terms of optimizing TB diagnostic strategies while considering cost–effectiveness.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.1730041503906,
        526.811767578125,
        402.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "One cost–affordability analysis, conducted in peripheral laboratories in Malawi and Viet",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        404.6730041503906,
        524.197998046875,
        417.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "Nam, highlighted the economic considerations of implementing TB LAMP and Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.1730041503906,
        524.47314453125,
        433.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "RIF. The study showed that per-test costs for TB LAMP were lower than those for Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.6730041503906,
        526.9644165039062,
        448.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "RIF. However, the potential financial burden of widespread implementation underscored the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.1730041503906,
        527.230712890625,
        464.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "importance of cost–effectiveness assessments in shaping diagnostic strategies. For more details",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.966097831726074,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.6730041503906,
        172.74710083007812,
        479.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "see  . Web Annex B.9",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.6769104003906,
        526.9669189453125,
        503.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "The reviewed studies had some limitations, such as variations in settings, sample sources and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.1768798828125,
        524.5906982421875,
        519.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "comparators, which may influence the generalizability of findings. Additionally, the cost–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.6768798828125,
        526.6534423828125,
        534.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "affordability analysis underscores the financial implications of nationwide implementation,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.1768798828125,
        526.9788208007812,
        550.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "suggesting the need for careful budgetary planning and allocation. Furthermore, the Global",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.6768798828125,
        526.9613037109375,
        565.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "Drug Facility’s recent decrease in the price of TB LAMP (new price, US$ 6) may have an impact",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1768798828125,
        527.1714477539062,
        581.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "on the results of economic evaluations, potentially enhancing the cost–effectiveness and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.6768798828125,
        354.056884765625,
        596.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "affordability of implementing TB LAMP in diverse settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.680908203125,
        526.9645385742188,
        620.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "These collective findings suggest that TB LAMP holds promise as a cost-effective and efficient",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.180908203125,
        526.6853637695312,
        636.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic tool for TB when integrated into broader diagnostic algorithms, particularly in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.680908203125,
        218.1873016357422,
        651.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "resource-constrained settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        662.684814453125,
        506.9651184082031,
        675.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "More details on the economic evaluation of LC-mNAATs are available in  . Web Annex B.9",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.1964111328125,
        179.01329040527344,
        704.576416015625
      ],
      "text": "User perspective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.0143432617188,
        293.04150390625,
        727.8953247070312
      ],
      "text": "This section deals with the following question:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 45",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}